      "partial_result": "The proved \\(thm:same\\text{-}class\\text{-}testing\\text{-}converse\\) and the\ndeterministic interval \\([-2M,2M]\\) give the closed fallback bracket\n\\[\n r_{n,d,M}\\lesssim_{\\epsilon,\\alpha}\n \\mathsf W^*_{n,d,\\epsilon,M,\\alpha}\\le4M,\n\\]\nas proved in \\(prop:honest\\text{-}length\\text{-}loose\\text{-}bracket\\).\nThe asserted matching upper bound of order \\(r_{n,d,M}\\) still requires\n\\(thm:global\\text{-}honest\\text{-}upper\\), and the certified attainment claim\nalso requires \\(prop:certified\\text{-}finite\\text{-}precision\\text{-}implementation\\)."
